msgstr "90 dana"

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A check sets a component's state without anyone's hand, and Yuva tells your team when it goes down or up."
msgstr "Provjera postavlja stanje komponente bez ičije intervencije, a Yuva obavještava vaš tim kada komponenta padne ili se oporavi."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "a contact and their data"
msgstr "kontakt i njegovi podaci"

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A conversation in the {platform} SDK: a question about an order and the team's replies with a tracking link, and a box to write back."
msgstr "Razgovor u SDK-u za {platform}: pitanje o narudžbi i odgovori tima s poveznicom za praćenje te polje za odgovor."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A customer can dismiss it. It returns when the incident gets a new update."
msgstr "Klijent je može zatvoriti. Vraća se kada incident dobije novo ažuriranje."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A customer writes to one of your support addresses, for example support@example.com."
msgstr "Klijent piše na jednu od vaših adresa za podršku, na primjer support@example.com."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A finished import in the panel: 6 conversations and 12 messages copied from an mbox file, with a note that Yuva has no access to your mailbox."
msgstr "Dovršen uvoz u panelu: 6 razgovora i 12 poruka kopirano iz mbox datoteke, uz napomenu da Yuva nema pristup vašem poštanskom sandučiću."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A footer band: a coloured square and the state in words, a strip of 90 days with the uptime, and Status by Yuva."
msgstr "Traka u podnožju: obojeni kvadrat i stanje riječima, traka od 90 dana s dostupnošću i Status by Yuva."

#: src/copy/contact.ts
msgid "A hosted service and commercial licenses"
msgstr "Hostirana usluga i komercijalne licence"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A message can be up to 25 MiB including attachments, which is the Cloudflare Email Routing limit. Yuva keeps up to 50 attachments per message, each within the server's attachment size limit (25 MiB by default) and allowed types; it leaves out the rest."
msgstr "Poruka može imati do 25 MiB uključujući privitke, što je ograničenje Cloudflare Email Routinga. Yuva zadržava do 50 privitaka po poruci, svaki unutar ograničenja veličine privitaka na poslužitelju (zadano 25 MiB) i dopuštenih vrsta; ostalo izostavlja."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A notice waits 60 seconds so you can undo it, and notices about one incident keep their distance, so a long outage does not flood inboxes."
msgstr "Obavijest čeka 60 sekundi kako biste je mogli poništiti, a obavijesti o istom incidentu drže razmak, pa dugi ispad ne preplavi sandučiće."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A page stays private until you publish it, and your team previews it in the panel before that."
msgstr "Stranica ostaje privatna dok je ne objavite, a vaš tim je prije toga pregledava u ploči."

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "A project that already uses shadcn/ui, with React and Tailwind CSS."
msgstr "Projekt koji već koristi shadcn/ui, s Reactom i Tailwind CSS-om."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "A public page for the state of your products, kept in the same inbox as your support. Checks keep it current and subscribers hear by e-mail."
msgstr "Javna stranica sa stanjem vaših proizvoda, u istom sandučiću kao vaša podrška. Provjere je održavaju ažurnom, a pretplatnici saznaju e-poštom."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A public status page with components, incidents, maintenance and history, kept current by checks and by your team. E-mail subscribers, a line in the chat widget and the apps, and one reply to everyone who wrote."
msgstr "Javna stranica statusa s komponentama, incidentima, održavanjem i poviješću, ažurna zahvaljujući provjerama i vašem timu. Pretplatnici e-poštom, redak u widgetu za chat i aplikacijama te jedan odgovor svima koji su pisali."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A sample status page: the overall state, an open incident and four components with their last 90 days as coloured bars."
msgstr "Primjer stranice statusa: ukupno stanje, otvoreni incident i četiri komponente sa zadnjih 90 dana kao obojenim stupcima."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "A small open-source Worker"
msgstr "Mali open-source Worker"

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
msgid "A Yuva chat channel and its public key (yuva_pk_…)."
msgstr "Yuva chat kanal i njegov javni ključ (yuva_pk_…)."

#: src/copy/status.ts
msgid "A Yuva status page shows whether your product works. It sits in your support inbox, so your chat widget and apps show an open incident, and one reply answers everyone who wrote about it."
msgstr "Yuvina stranica statusa pokazuje radi li vaš proizvod. Živi u vašem sandučiću podrške, pa widget za chat i aplikacije prikazuju otvoreni incident, a jedan odgovor stiže svima koji su pisali o njemu."

#: src/copy/home.ts
msgid "Accepted answer"
msgstr "Prihvaćen odgovor"

