#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "The Worker is one way to call /ingress/email. Any mail server or relay can post the raw message with the same signed headers, and a mail server that delivers to a command can pipe the message into yuva ingest-email. The request format is documented in the Worker's README."
msgstr "Worker je jedan od načina za pozivanje /ingress/email. Bilo koji poštanski poslužitelj ili relej može poslati sirovu poruku s istim potpisanim zaglavljima, a poštanski poslužitelj koji isporučuje naredbi može proslijediti poruku u yuva ingest-email. Format zahtjeva dokumentiran je u README-u Workera."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "The Worker signs the raw message, both envelope addresses and a timestamp with HMAC-SHA256 under a secret you share with Yuva, and sends them to /ingress/email on your Yuva server."
msgstr "Worker potpisuje sirovu poruku, obje adrese omotnice i vremensku oznaku pomoću HMAC-SHA256 s tajnom koju dijelite s Yuvom i šalje ih na /ingress/email na vašem Yuva poslužitelju."

